{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52225","headline":"颂六十二首 五十 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 五十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"只园感神夹，鹿苑化拘隣。\n圣人居福地，贤士乐山园。\n乍闻千叶现，时动百华鲜。\n香草皆满地，灵芝徧房前。\n甘池流八水，神井涌九泉。\n华旛高颻扬，应感下飞仙。\n鸟弄千声啭，人歌百福田。\n盛哉兹胜处，谁见不留连。\n（见同书卷八十《种子部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52225.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52225","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}